	quest.13AD566A7B53B4A9.quest_desc: ["Build the permanent drill through its sixteen-operation quarry, pressure, drive, sensing, control, routing, grid, lubrication, and closure line; consume a processed sample for a cartridge, run a bounded batch, and recover after power loss.","Mechanical commissioning: finish the deep drill on a Titanium Greate Press or higher. Feed the installation from the existing high-pressure material, lubricant and control lines; preserve ordinary extraction for recovery."]
